       3. Get(): use to launch the any URL over browser
       4. Close():close the browser window.
       5. getTitle(): which returns the title of page (String) 
       6. getCurrentURL(): Which returns the URL of current page (String)
       7. findElement() : Reads the control of the webpage, locates for the first occurences
       
       
       
       
